            "review_title": "Review at Gon & Nhe - Food & Beer",
            "review_text": "475valeska\nMelbourne, Australia47 contributions\n0\nGive it a miss.\nDec 2017\nA lover of vietnamese cuisine, I struggled to choose from this new bar's forced and poorly thought-out \"innovative\" menu. The offering is more suited as finger food for the peckish beer drinker than as a meal in itself. Despite coming in hungry we left half of our already scant portions uneaten because the food was overcooked to the point of dryness. Service is fairly quick but wait staff need a lesson in discrete service as hovering at the next table literally looking over patrons food while they eat is off-putting.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 11, 2018",
